), 30-day volume with its change against the 30 days before (only venues whose record covers the window are counted, and the rest are named), sector tags, and the price change over 5 minutes to a day while the five-minute read is current. Open interest, 24-hour and 30-day volume and the shares are over the venues with a reading this hour: venuesExcluded names a venue listing the market without one (archive_day_behind: Binance and Bybit, whose public archives run a day behind; timed_out or not_recorded: a venue the hour could not read), and each venue's shareOf says OI only when every venue listing the market reports one this hour, else reported OI.\"}}"}],"isError":false}}

